# Hardcoded mise shim - deterministic on every machine (a template-time
# PATH lookup would depend on the applying machine's PATH). Bootstrap
# caveat: before the first `mise install`, `chezmoi diff` aborts with a
# fork/exec error (apply unaffected) - re-run after install. Full detail
# lives in AGENTS.md ("Check for drift").
diff:
  command: ~/.local/share/mise/shims/delta
